  "Body": {
    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "<p>To meet new workload demands, Azure Firewall Basic, Standard, Premium and Azure Firewall Manager are now generally available in these four new regions:</p>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n\t<li><strong>Israel Central</strong></li>\r\n\t<li><strong>Italy North</strong></li>\r\n\t<li><strong>Mexico Central</strong></li>\r\n\t<li><strong>Spain Central</strong></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p>With these new regions, Azure Firewall is now available in&nbsp;<a href=\"https://nam06.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fazure.microsoft.com%2Fexplore%2Fglobal-infrastructure%2Fproducts-by-region%2F%3Fproducts%3Dazure-firewall&amp;data=05%7C02%7CEliran.Azulai%40microsoft.com%7Ce56c353ebb3e4852d04508dc74b56a4c%7C72f988bf86f141af91ab2d7cd011db47%7C1%7C0%7C638513569715326510%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=JT8%2FxgFbgWMuOx2%2BkWpiXD4xoS59vHnUTdCkwXnahcI%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">64 regions worldwide</a>, utilizing the Microsoft global network backbone.&nbsp;</p>\r\n",
    "Markdown": "To meet new workload demands, Azure Firewall Basic, Standard, Premium and Azure Firewall Manager are now generally available in these four new regions:\n\nIsrael Central\n\nItaly North\n\nMexico Central\n\nSpain Central\n\nWith these new regions, Azure Firewall is now available in 64 regions worldwide , utilizing the Microsoft global network backbone."
  },
